    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The existing text doesn't actually say what the problem is, just that it \"won't work.\" This PR attempts to add some substance to \"won't work.\"</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I encountered this in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3289152395\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3200\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3200/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3200\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3200</a>, where the note text wasn't helpful in understanding whether there ought to be a Baseline regression and I had to read the complete bug anyway.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3258361706\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27392\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27392/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27392\">#27392</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3289152395\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3200\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3200/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3200\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3200</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27522",
            "title": "Clarify notes for Safari `setHTMLUnsafe()` and friends",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-06T13:11:01.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-06T12:50:58.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ddbeck",
                "url": "https://github.com/ddbeck"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6960788?u=0f065d939acde32c4377d427c2d3181b50c65ced&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Marks <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/InputDeviceInfo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">InputDeviceInfo</code></a> as unsupported by firefox.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Noticed issue by trying <a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/6x3dr7hL/\" rel=\"nofollow\">this jsfiddle</a>, which is simply <code class=\"notranslate\">const info = MediaDeviceInfo</code>, and results in <code class=\"notranslate\">InputDeviceInfo is not defined</code> in current Firefox.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tried to find a few citable sources to substantiate the claim, here's what I found on searchfox.org:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/testing/web-platform/meta/mediacapture-streams/MediaDevices-enumerateDevices.https.html.ini\" rel=\"nofollow\">MediaDevices-enumerateDevices.https.html.ini</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"[InputDeviceInfo is supported]\n  expected: FAIL\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">[InputDeviceInfo is supported]\n  expected: FAIL\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/testing/web-platform/meta/mediacapture-streams/idlharness.https.window.js.ini\" rel=\"nofollow\">idlharness.https.window.js.ini</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"  [InputDeviceInfo interface: existence and properties of interface prototype object]\n    expected: FAIL\n\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">  [InputDeviceInfo interface: existence and properties of interface prototype object]\n    expected: FAIL\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/webidl/moz.build\" rel=\"nofollow\">moz.build</a>:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Doesn't include <code class=\"notranslate\">InputDeviceInfo.idl</code>, only  <code class=\"notranslate\">MediaDeviceInfo.idl</code>, which <a href=\"https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/webidl/MediaDeviceInfo.webidl\" rel=\"nofollow\">doesn't contain <code class=\"notranslate\">InputDeviceInfo</code></a></p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27495.\">fixes</span>: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3292618971\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27495\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27495/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27495\">#27495</a></li>\n</ul>",
