        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 139 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">corner-shape</code> property, and its related shorthands and longhand. The properties have already been added to BCD by the collector, but the types that it can take as values have not.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds data for the types.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that I have included two data points for <code class=\"notranslate\">superellipse()</code> — one for the function itself, and one for the use of <code class=\"notranslate\">superellipse()</code> as a <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;corner-shape-value&gt;</code>. I thought this was a good idea in case <code class=\"notranslate\">superellipse()</code> has more parameter options added, or is used as a possible value for other properties in the future.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27505",
            "title": "Chrome 139 corner-shape types",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-05T14:54:01.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-05T14:53:26.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/blog/pna-on-hold\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/pna-on-hold</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/blog/local-network-access\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/local-network-access</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27492",
