        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96347576?u=798adeac17b0340c3666d020c6f3391d71339849&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added a sub-feature to <code class=\"notranslate\">html.elements.input.type_date</code> to indicate when browsers prevent picking dates outside the min/max range in the date picker UI.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As cited in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3026356562\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26656\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26656/hovercard?comment_id=2867357979&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26656#issuecomment-2867357979\">#26656 (comment)</a> .<br>\nPlease <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/caugner/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/caugner\">@caugner</a>, confirm the versions.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n \n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #26656.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3026356562\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26656\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26656/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26656\">#26656</a></p>\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27450",
            "title": "add disables_invalid_values_in_picker_ui sub-feature to input type=date",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-30T14:55:03.000Z",
